  "body": "This is a small fix for the \"report an error\" algorithm for scripts. Fixes #7501.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * This is a spec bug and shouldn't affect implementations.\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * The intended behavior (that module scripts aren't muted) is likely tested already https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/master/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/module\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Should not be needed.\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7515/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 20, 2022, 12:30 AM UTC (720b069)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7515/72caa31...720b069/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 20, 2022, 12:30 AM UTC (720b069)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7515/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 20, 2022, 12:30 AM UTC (720b069)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7515/72caa31...720b069/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 20, 2022, 12:30 AM UTC (720b069)\">diff</a> )",
